{"seq":3,"slug":"metagenomics-soil-microbiome","title":"博士农学 — 宏基因组学与土壤微生物组","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/agricultural-research/omics-approaches/metagenomics-soil-microbiome","wordCount":2050,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士农学-宏基因组学与土壤微生物组\">博士农学 — 宏基因组学与土壤微生物组</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>土壤是地球上微生物多样性最丰富的栖息地——每克土壤包含数十亿微生物细胞和数万个物种。宏基因组学（Metagenomics）绕过传统纯培养的瓶颈，直接从环境样本中提取 DNA 进行测序分析，为研究农业土壤微生物的组成、功能和生态过程提供了革命性工具。对于农学博士研究者而言，理解根际微生物组（rhizosphere microbiome）与作物健康的互作机制，是开发微生物肥料、生物防治和土壤健康管理技术的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"扩增子测序-vs-鸟枪法宏基因组\">扩增子测序 vs 鸟枪法宏基因组</h3><p>两条技术路线各有适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>16S/ITS 扩增子</th>\n<th>鸟枪法宏基因组</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目标</td>\n<td>分类标记基因（16S rRNA / ITS）</td>\n<td>全部 DNA 片段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分辨率</td>\n<td>属级（有时种级）</td>\n<td>种级甚至株级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能信息</td>\n<td>无（仅分类组成）</td>\n<td>有（功能基因、通路）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本/样本</td>\n<td>低（$50-100）</td>\n<td>高（$200-500）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测序深度</td>\n<td>10-50K reads/样本</td>\n<td>5-20 Gb/样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宿主污染</td>\n<td>低（引物特异性）</td>\n<td>高（需要过滤植物 DNA）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型应用</td>\n<td>群落组成调查、多样性比较</td>\n<td>功能通路分析、基因组组装</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择策略：如果主要目标是比较不同处理下的群落结构差异（如施肥方式对细菌多样性的影响），16S 扩增子测序成本效益更高；如果需要了解功能潜力（如氮循环相关基因丰度），则需要鸟枪法宏基因组。</p>\n<h3 id=\"16s-扩增子分析流程\">16S 扩增子分析流程</h3><p>标准分析流程可概括为：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始 Reads] --&gt; B[质控与引物去除]&#10;    B --&gt; C[去噪 / OTU 聚类]&#10;    C --&gt; D[ASV/OTU 表]&#10;    D --&gt; E[分类注释]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Alpha 多样性]&#10;    D --&gt; G[Beta 多样性]&#10;    E --&gt; H[差异丰度分析]&#10;    G --&gt; I[PERMANOVA 检验]\">graph TD\n    A[原始 Reads] --&gt; B[质控与引物去除]\n    B --&gt; C[去噪 / OTU 聚类]\n    C --&gt; D[ASV/OTU 表]\n    D --&gt; E[分类注释]\n    D --&gt; F[Alpha 多样性]\n    D --&gt; G[Beta 多样性]\n    E --&gt; H[差异丰度分析]\n    G --&gt; I[PERMANOVA 检验]</pre><p><strong>去噪 vs OTU 聚类</strong>：传统方法以 97% 相似度聚类 OTU，但 DADA2 和 Deblur 等去噪算法生成的 ASV（Amplicon Sequence Variants）具有单碱基分辨率，且跨研究可比较，已成为当前标准。</p>\n<p><strong>Alpha 多样性</strong>衡量单个样本内的微生物多样性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Observed ASVs</td>\n<td>计数</td>\n<td>物种丰富度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shannon</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H&#x27; = -\\sum_{i=1}^{S} p_i \\ln p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2809em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>丰富度 + 均匀度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Simpson</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = 1 - \\sum_{i=1}^{S} p_i^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2809em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>优势度反转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Faith&#39;s PD</td>\n<td>系统发育树总枝长</td>\n<td>进化多样性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Beta 多样性</strong>衡量样本间的群落差异。常用距离度量包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bray-Curtis</strong>：基于丰度的非系统发育距离</li>\n<li><strong>UniFrac</strong>（加权/非加权）：整合系统发育信息的距离</li>\n</ul>\n<p>加权 UniFrac 考虑物种丰度和系统发育关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{WU}(A,B) = \\frac{\\sum_i b_i |A_i - B_i|}{\\sum_i b_i (A_i + B_i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为系统发育树第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 条枝的长度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该枝下游所有 ASV 在样本 A 和 B 中的相对丰度之和。</p>\n<p><strong>PERMANOVA</strong>（Permutational MANOVA）检验处理组间群落组成差异的统计显著性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = \\frac{SS_{between} / (k-1)}{SS_{within} / (N-k)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hin</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 值通过排列检验（通常 999 次）获得，无需假设正态分布。</p>\n<h3 id=\"鸟枪法宏基因组分析\">鸟枪法宏基因组分析</h3><p>鸟枪法测序产生的数据体量大（每样本 5-20 Gb），分析流程包括：</p>\n<p><strong>组装策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Co-assembly</strong>：将所有样本的 reads 合并组装，提高稀有物种的组装连续性</li>\n<li><strong>Per-sample assembly</strong>：分别组装每个样本，避免嵌合 contigs，适合样本间差异大的情况</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>分箱（Binning）</strong> 将组装的 contigs 归属到个体基因组（MAG, Metagenome-Assembled Genome）。主流工具（MetaBAT2, MaxBin2, CONCOCT）使用两类信号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>序列组成</strong>：四核苷酸频率（TNF）反映物种基因组特征</li>\n<li><strong>覆盖度协变</strong>：来自同一基因组的 contigs 在不同样本中的丰度应高度相关</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MAG 质量评估使用 CheckM2：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>质量等级</th>\n<th>完整度</th>\n<th>污染率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高质量</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中质量</td>\n<td>&gt; 50%</td>\n<td>&lt; 10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低质量</td>\n<td>&lt; 50%</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MIMAG 标准还要求高质量 MAG 包含 16S/23S/5S rRNA 基因和 ≥ 18 个 tRNA。</p>\n<p><strong>功能注释</strong>：基因预测（Prodigal）后通过同源比对注释功能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>KEGG</strong>：代谢通路层级（ko → module → pathway）</li>\n<li><strong>CAZy</strong>：碳水化合物活性酶（与土壤有机质分解直接相关）</li>\n<li><strong>NCyc/PCyc</strong>：氮循环/磷循环专用数据库</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"根际微生物组研究设计\">根际微生物组研究设计</h3><p>根际（rhizosphere）是植物根系表面 1-2 mm 范围内受根系分泌物强烈影响的土壤区域。根际微生物组研究的采样策略直接决定数据质量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔室</th>\n<th>采样方法</th>\n<th>微生物群落特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>非根际土壤（Bulk soil）</td>\n<td>距根系 &gt; 5 cm 处取样</td>\n<td>环境基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根际土壤（Rhizosphere）</td>\n<td>抖落法：轻抖根系收集附着土壤</td>\n<td>根系招募群落</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根面（Rhizoplane）</td>\n<td>超声波清洗根表面收集微生物</td>\n<td>紧密附着群落</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根内（Endosphere）</td>\n<td>表面消毒后研磨根组织</td>\n<td>内生菌群落</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>根际效应（rhizosphere effect）导致根际群落与非根际土壤显著不同。植物通过根系分泌物（有机酸、糖类、氨基酸——约占光合碳的 5-21%）选择性招募有益微生物。</p>\n<p>定量研究根际富集效应的常用方法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Enrichment ratio</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>Abundance</mtext><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mtext>Abundance</mtext><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Enrichment ratio} = \\log_2\\left(\\frac{\\text{Abundance}_{rhizosphere}}{\\text{Abundance}_{bulk}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Enrichment ratio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Abundance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Abundance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>结合差异丰度分析（DESeq2 或 ANCOM-BC），可鉴定在根际显著富集的分类群及其与植物健康的潜在关联。</p>\n<h3 id=\"syncom-与因果验证\">SynCom 与因果验证</h3><p>观测性的微生物组研究只能建立相关性，因果验证需要合成群落（Synthetic Community, SynCom）实验：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从测序数据中鉴定候选功能微生物</li>\n<li>分离培养目标菌株（约 50-70% 的根际细菌可培养）</li>\n<li>构建简化群落（通常 7-30 个菌株）</li>\n<li>在无菌植物系统（gnotobiotic）中验证功能</li>\n</ol>\n<p>SynCom 实验设计遵循 Koch 法则的现代改编：观察（测序） → 分离 → 接种 → 重现表型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某实验比较有机肥和化肥对小麦根际细菌群落的影响，16S 测序后得到 ASV 表。请设计完整的统计分析流程：从 alpha 多样性比较到 beta 多样性 PERMANOVA 检验，再到差异丰度分析。应使用哪些距离度量？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>鸟枪法宏基因组组装后获得 150 个 MAGs，CheckM2 评估显示 40 个为高质量。如果研究目标是比较不同施肥处理对土壤氮循环功能的影响，应选择哪些功能注释数据库？如何从 MAG 层面量化氮循环基因的丰度差异？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个 SynCom 实验来验证&quot;特定的根际细菌组合可以提高水稻磷吸收效率&quot;这一假设。明确：菌株筛选标准、实验对照设置、表型测量指标和统计分析方法。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>16S 扩增子测序中 V3-V4 区域和 V4 区域的选择如何影响群落组成的估计？讨论引物偏好性（primer bias）对特定门类（如 Planctomycetes）检出率的影响。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Callahan, B.J. et al. (2016). &quot;DADA2: High-resolution sample inference from Illumina amplicon data.&quot; <em>Nature Methods</em> — ASV 去噪方法的标准参考。</li>\n<li>Parks, D.H. et al. (2015). &quot;CheckM: assessing the quality of microbial genomes.&quot; <em>Genome Research</em> — MAG 质量评估框架。</li>\n<li>Vorholt, J.A. et al. (2017). &quot;Establishing causality: opportunities of synthetic communities for plant microbiome research.&quot; <em>Cell Host &amp; Microbe</em> — SynCom 方法论综述。</li>\n<li>QIIME2（<a href=\"https://qiime2.org）：扩增子分析的标准流程框架。\">https://qiime2.org）：扩增子分析的标准流程框架。</a></li>\n<li>R 包 <code>phyloseq</code> 和 <code>microbiome</code>：微生物组数据可视化与统计分析。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>宏基因组学为农业土壤微生物研究提供了从分类组成（16S 扩增子）到功能潜力（鸟枪法）的完整工具链。根际微生物组研究揭示了植物—微生物互作的分子对话机制，而 SynCom 实验桥接了观测相关性与功能因果性之间的鸿沟。对于农学研究者，关键在于根据研究问题选择合适的技术路线，并在实验设计阶段就考虑采样策略对下游统计推断的影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-相关专题\">本 hub 相关专题</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"transcriptomics-metabolomics\">转录组与代谢组学</a>：差异丰度分析与差异表达分析共用负二项 / DESeq2 统计框架；根系分泌物的代谢谱是理解根际招募机制的化学侧写。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../field-experiment-design/long-term-field-experiments\">长期定位试验</a>：施肥与轮作处理持续数十年的长期平台，为微生物群落的慢变量演替研究提供了唯一可行的时间序列。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士农学 — 宏基因组学与土壤微生物组","id":"博士农学-宏基因组学与土壤微生物组"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"扩增子测序 vs 鸟枪法宏基因组","id":"扩增子测序-vs-鸟枪法宏基因组"},{"level":3,"text":"16S 扩增子分析流程","id":"16s-扩增子分析流程"},{"level":3,"text":"鸟枪法宏基因组分析","id":"鸟枪法宏基因组分析"},{"level":3,"text":"根际微生物组研究设计","id":"根际微生物组研究设计"},{"level":3,"text":"SynCom 与因果验证","id":"syncom-与因果验证"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本 hub 相关专题","id":"本-hub-相关专题"}],"prev":{"title":"博士农学 — 转录组与代谢组学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/agricultural-research/omics-approaches/transcriptomics-metabolomics"},"next":{"title":"博士农学 — 农业生命周期评价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/agricultural-research/sustainability-metrics/life-cycle-assessment"}}